  sig=func (s *Server) buildUpstreamRequest(ctx context.Context, r *http.Request, dec *routing.Decision, body []byte) (*http.Request, error)
  doc=buildUpstreamRequest copies the inbound request body to a new\nupstream request bound to dec.UpstreamURL. Sets Authorization +\ncontent type. BYO calls use the caller's UserAPIKey; metered\ncalls use the gateway's own provider key.
